Instance: IMMZ.Persona.HealthWorker
InstanceOf: ActorDefinition
Usage: #definition
* status = #draft
* experimental = true
* name = "HealthWorker"
* title = "Health worker (HW)"
* type = #person
* description = """
Health workers facilitate education sessions, administer immunizations, provide counselling when needed, record vaccinations administered, record stock movements and compile, generate, and submit reports.

**Alternate names**: Nurse, registered nurse, practical nurse.

**ISCO-08**: 3221 Nursing associate professional.

A targeted generic persona of the WHO Digital Adaptation Kit for Immunizations.
"""
* documentation = "https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/380303"
